{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A regular hexagon and an equilateral triangle have equal areas. What is the ratio of the length of a side of the triangle to the length of a side of the hexagon?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/4/d1465a1dd3e915e1fae5060bc6ada57aa42319d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }\\sqrt{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }\\sqrt{6} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"372\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/d/a3d5cb6abc27e4e185d2a0a6400d7a3ba22c291d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{\\triangle} = \\frac{s_t^2\\sqrt{3}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abeeeaba6881452045f9eba13228664711b790c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{hex} = \\frac{6s_h^2\\sqrt{3}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"117\" height=\"43\" /> since a regular hexagon is just six equilateral triangles.\n</p><p>Setting the areas equal, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/514d88d9d841a18f279e9c444e5157a729797859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_t^2 = 6s_h^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b2a0c59ff67a9f5efba89634d958b4d4b29a41b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{s_t}{s_h}\\right)^2 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"87\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4ee93072dfc83521a97b632666505ae4e16b571a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{s_t}{s_h} = \\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"70\" height=\"35\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" ro